    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const address = items[0].json.address || 'El Paso TX';\nconst prompt = `You are a real estate CMA expert for El Paso, TX. Generate a realistic Comparative Market Analysis (CMA) for the property at ${address}. You MUST respond with ONLY valid JSON. No markdown code blocks, no explanation, no text before or after. Just raw JSON with these exact keys: subject_property (object: address, beds, baths, sqft, lot_size, year_built), comparable_sales (array of 3 objects: address, sale_price, sale_date, sqft, price_per_sqft), market_trends (object: median_price, avg_days_on_market, inventory_level, price_trend), pricing_recommendation (object: suggested_list_price, price_range_low, price_range_high, rationale). Use realistic El Paso market data.`;\n\nitems[0].json.requestBody = JSON.stringify({\n  model: \"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\",\n  max_tokens: 3000,\n  messages: [{role: \"user\", content: prompt}]\n});\nitems[0].json.address = address;\nreturn items;"
      },
      "name": "Build Body",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        300
      ],
      "id": "build-body-node"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "lorena.realtor@icloud.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $node[\"Extract Data\"].json.email || \"\" }}",
        "subject": "=Your Comparative Market Analysis for {{ $node[\"Extract Data\"].json.address }}",
        "contentHtml": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 style=\"color:#2D5A27;\">Your CMA Report</h2><p>Hi there!</p><p>Here is your Comparative Market Analysis for <strong>{{ $node[\"Extract Data\"].json.address }}</strong>.</p><p>Based on recent comparable sales in your area, here are the highlights:</p><p><strong>Suggested List Price:</strong> ${{ $node[\"Parse CMA\"].json.pricing_recommendation?.suggested_list_price || \"Contact me for details\" }}</p><p>I'd love to discuss these numbers in detail. Call me anytime!</p><p>- Lorena</p></div>",
        "contentType": "text/html"
      },
